flowchart LR
accTitle: How a new node catches up
accDescr: A saved snapshot is downloaded and restored onto the server disk. The node applies blocks made after the snapshot, then keeps applying new committed blocks.
snapshot[("Saved snapshot")]:::network
subgraph S["Your AWS server · first setup"]
 download["Download"]:::service
 restore["Restore database"]:::service
 catchup["Catch up"]:::service
 live[("Synced node")]:::data
end
blocks["Validators’ committed blocks"]:::network
snapshot -->|"Recent saved state"| download
 download --> restore --> catchup --> live
blocks -->|"Blocks since the snapshot"| catchup
blocks -->|"New blocks keep arriving"| live
